  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 405.04 Regulatory Markers. Regulatory markers shall be geometric figures painted international orange and white. Regulatory markers shall indicate the existence of danger, speed zones, swim areas and other controls. Spelled-out words or recognized abbreviations may appear on these markers to convey their meaning to vessel operators.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES, 5-3-95; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8093, EMERGENCY, eff 5-28-04, EXPIRES: 11-24-04; ss by 8172, eff 9-21-04; ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
